"Welcome to Launchy" = "Fáilte go Launchy";
"This SwiftUI scaffold is ready for your ideas." = "Tá an t-ardán SwiftUI seo réidh do do smaointe.";
"Increase Counter" = "Méadaigh an cuntar";
"Counter: %lld" = "Cuntar: %lld";

"Floaty or fullscreen" = "Snámhphainéal nó lánscáileán";
"Pick the layout that fits the moment. Floaty hovers above your desktop, while fullscreen feels like classic Launchpad." = "Roghnaigh an leagan amach a oireann don nóiméad. Lúnn an snámhphainéal os cionn do dheisce, agus mothaíonn lánscáileán cosúil le Launchpad clasaiceach.";
"Floaty mode" = "Mód snámhphainéil";
"A panel that stays light and quick. Hide the Dock icon if you want a minimal feel." = "Painéal éadrom sciobtha. Folaigh deilbhín an Duga más mian leat íosléiriú.";
"Fullscreen mode" = "Mód lánscáileáin";
"Fill the screen for a focused, grid-first workflow." = "Líon an scáileán le sreabhadh oibre fócasaithe bunaithe ar ghreille.";
"Flip instantly" = "Athraigh láithreach";
"Add a layout toggle shortcut in Settings to jump between modes anytime." = "Cuir aicearra scoránaithe leagain amach i Socruithe chun léim idir módanna am ar bith.";
"Hotkeys you control" = "Aicearraí faoi do smacht";
"Launchy ships with Cmd+Shift+Space, but you can set your own shortcuts in Settings > Keyboard." = "Tagann Launchy le Cmd+Shift+Space, ach is féidir aicearraí féin a shocrú i Socruithe > Méarchlár.";
"Toggle Launchy anywhere" = "Scoránaigh Launchy áit ar bith";
"Record the shortcut you want to open or hide the launcher." = "Taifead an t-aicearra is mian leat chun an tosaitheoir a oscailt nó a cheilt.";
"Layout toggle" = "Scorán leagain amach";
"Set an optional hotkey to swap floaty and fullscreen on demand." = "Socraigh aicearra roghnach chun snámhphainéal agus lánscáileán a mhalartú de réir mar is gá.";
"Reset friendly" = "Athshocrú gan stró";
"Use Reset in Settings if you ever want the defaults back." = "Úsáid Athshocraigh i Socruithe má theastaíonn uait na réamhshocruithe ar ais riamh.";
"Search & organize" = "Cuardaigh agus eagraigh";
"Type to filter instantly, drag to reorder, and build folders when you need them." = "Clóscríobh chun scagadh láithreach, tarraing chun athordú, agus cruthaigh fillteáin nuair is gá.";
"Instant search" = "Cuardach láithreach";
"The search bar narrows results as you type, then Enter launches the first match." = "Caolaíonn an barra cuardaigh torthaí de réir mar a chlóscríobhann tú, ansin seolann Enter an chéad toradh.";
"Rearrange easily" = "Athchóirigh go héasca";
"Drag icons to reorder pages. Hold Option or Shift while dragging to create folders." = "Tarraing deilbhíní chun leathanaigh a athordú. Coinnigh Option nó Shift le linn tarraingthe chun fillteáin a chruthú.";
"Name folders fast" = "Ainmnigh fillteáin go tapa";
"Drop onto another app to make a folder, then rename it inline." = "Scaoil ar aip eile chun fillteán a dhéanamh, ansin athainmnigh ar an toirt.";
"Right-click for power" = "Cliceáil ar dheis le haghaidh cumhachta";
"Context menus unlock more control wherever you click." = "Osclaíonn roghchláir comhthéacs smacht breise cibé áit a gcliceálann tú.";
"App actions" = "Gníomhartha aipe";
"Right-click any app to rename it, move pages, hide it, or jump into folders." = "Cliceáil ar dheis ar aon aip chun í a athainmniú, leathanaigh a bhogadh, í a cheilt, nó léim isteach i bhfillteáin.";
"Folder tools" = "Uirlisí fillteáin";
"Rename, reorder, and move folders between pages with the same menu." = "Athainmnigh, athordaigh, agus bog fillteáin idir leathanaigh leis an roghchlár céanna.";
"Blank canvas" = "Canbhás folamh";
"Right-click the background to drop in a new folder whenever you need one." = "Cliceáil ar dheis ar an gcúlra chun fillteán nua a chur isteach aon uair is gá.";
